{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@CLLocationDirection","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CLLocationDirection"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"direction"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The value ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means that the top edge of the map view corresponds to true","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"north. The value ","type":"text"},{"code":"90","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means the top of the map is pointing due east. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value ","type":"text"},{"code":"180","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means the top of the map points due south, and so on.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Changing the value of this property updates the map view immediately. If you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"want to animate the change, use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"-setDirection:animated:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method instead.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/direction"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The heading of the map, measured in degrees clockwise from true north."}],"metadata":{"title":"direction","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"direction"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView(py)direction","fragments":[{"text":"direction","kind